cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use MetaMaPy in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "MetaMaPy: A Python re-implementation of MetaMapLite for UMLS concept extraction"
abstract: >-
  MetaMaPy maps free biomedical and clinical text to UMLS Metathesaurus concepts.
  It is a from-source Python re-implementation of NLM's MetaMapLite (longest-match
  dictionary lookup, MetaMap 4-component scoring, MMI ranking, NegEx negation,
  and abbreviation detection), emitting MMI and JSON output.
type: software
authors:
